# Build / Packaging
# Anchored to the repo root and to backend/: unanchored `lib/` and `build/`
# match at ANY depth, which silently swallowed frontend/src/lib/ — the app
# still built locally but a fresh clone was missing those source files.
/build/
/dist/
/downloads/
/develop-eggs/
/eggs/
/.eggs/
/lib/
/lib64/
/parts/
/sdist/
/var/
/wheels/
/share/python-wheels/
/pip-wheel-metadata/

backend/build/
backend/dist/
backend/lib/
backend/lib64/
backend/sdist/
backend/wheels/

*.egg-info/
*.egg
.installed.cfg
MANIFEST

